  "title": "Qt: Update splash screen for applying changed preferences",
  "description": "Add a registration step / splash screen display for applying\nchanged preferences at startup, and set that message when we\nstart to apply the preferences.\n\nThis still leaves an issue when opening at startup a file that\ntakes a long time to process a particular record (probably a\nTLS packet when the configured SSLKEYLOGFILE is very large,\nsee #17051), but at least in that case a message about applying\npreferences is essentially true, unlike a message about\nfind local interfaces.\n\nFix #19224",
